te this article.</p></fn><fn id="n2" fn-type="conflict"><p><bold>Competing Interests:</bold> The authors have declared that no competing interests exist.</p></fn><fn><p><bold>Provenance:</bold> This Debate arose from an uncommissioned submission by Blaise Genton and colleagues that was reviewed by Mike English. We then commissioned contributions to a Debate from each author, which were not otherwise peer reviewed.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>